  "name": "Depression Anxiety Stress Scales – Youth Version (DASS-Y)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Depression Anxiety Stress Scales – Youth version (DASS-Y) is a version of the DASS-21 for youth aged 7 – 18 years of age designed to measure general psychological distress and the negative emotional states of depression, anxiety and stress. The wording and focus of the questions is simplified compared to other versions of the DASS, making it more relevant for young people.",
